// 開關：拇指以彈簧滑動，移動途中被拉寬、壓扁（果凍感，峰值 1.28×0.86）。
import { Theme, Motion } from "../theme.slint";

export component Toggle {
    in-out property <bool> checked;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <string> label;
    callback toggled(checked: bool);
    width: 46px;
    height: 28px;
    opacity: enabled ? 1 : 0.45;
    accessible-role: switch;
    accessible-checkable: true;
    accessible-checked: checked;
    accessible-label: label;
    accessible-action-default => { ta.clicked(); }
    property <float> pos: checked ? 1 : 0;
    animate pos {
        duration: Motion.spring-dur;
        easing: Motion.spring;
    }
    // 移動途中的拉伸量：中段最大，兩端為 0
    property <float> stretch: Theme.reduce-motion ? 0 : clamp(4 * root.pos * (1 - root.pos), 0, 1);
    Rectangle {
        border-radius: self.height / 2;
        background: root.checked ? Theme.ink : Theme.line;
        animate background { duration: 350ms; }
    }
    Rectangle {
        property <length> w: 22px * (1 + 0.28 * root.stretch);
        property <length> h: 22px * (1 - 0.14 * root.stretch);
        width: self.w;
        height: self.h;
        x: 3px + 18px * root.pos - (self.w - 22px) / 2;
        y: (root.height - self.h) / 2;
        border-radius: self.h / 2;
        background: root.checked ? Theme.on-ink : Theme.knob;
        drop-shadow-color: #0E0F132E;
        drop-shadow-blur: 4px;
        drop-shadow-offset-y: 2px;
        animate background { duration: 350ms; }
    }
    ta := TouchArea {
        enabled: root.enabled;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => {
            root.checked = !root.checked;
            root.toggled(root.checked);
        }
    }
}
